OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Hidden_Rooms_Text_PellIntro::
	.string "You came down through the water?\n"
	.string "Then you've seen what we carry.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Hidden_Rooms_Text_PellDefeat::
	.string "...and you're still here.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Hidden_Rooms_Text_PellPostBattle::
	.string "Six strongrooms. The CAPTAIN had\n"
	.string "the only keys, and he threw them\l"
	.string "in the sea before we sank.\p"
	.string "Rusted through now. Help\n"
	.string "yourself.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Hidden_Rooms_Text_HoyleIntro::
	.string "Nobody was supposed to come down\n"
	.string "here. Not even us.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Hidden_Rooms_Text_HoyleDefeat::
	.string "Least of all me.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Hidden_Rooms_Text_HoylePostBattle::
	.string "We never asked what was in the\n"
	.string "crates. That was the arrangement.\p"
	.string "Twenty years down here and I\n"
	.string "still haven't looked.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Hidden_Rooms_Text_Crate::
	.string "A crate, swollen with seawater.\p"
	.string "The stencil on the side has\n"
	.string "washed off.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Hidden_Rooms_Text_Ledger::
	.string "A ledger, open and ruined.\p"
	.string "Only the last entry is still\n"
	.string "legible: SIX ROOMS. SIX KEYS.\l"
	.string "OVERBOARD.$"
